**Source code offer (GPL-2.0 §3):** This package redistributes the
`transmission-daemon` binary as an Alpine/musl fully static executable. The
binary is built from **unmodified** upstream Transmission source of the bundled
version (the application `version` in `manifest`, its first three parts, e.g.
`4.1.3.3` -> `4.1.3`). The corresponding source code is the upstream release:

- Source tarball: https://github.com/transmission/transmission/releases/download/4.1.3/transmission-4.1.3.tar.xz
- Release tag:    https://github.com/transmission/transmission/releases/tag/4.1.3

The build scripts that produce the static binary (Alpine container + CMake
static link, including the exact `build.sh` invocation) are maintained in this
repository:

- https://github.com/sushazhi/fnos-transmission/blob/main/.github/workflows/build-and-release.yml

In accordance with GPL-2.0 §3(b), a written offer valid for at least three
years is hereby made: any third party may request the complete corresponding
source code by opening an issue at
https://github.com/sushazhi/fnos-transmission/issues.

